iscovery-001", "next_step": "research", "question": "Can an artificial process formulate, evaluate, and pursue novel, self-generated objectives without explicit human or external instruction?", "title": "Mechanisms for Autonomous Objective Discovery"}], "beliefs": [], "mode": "shadow", "open_commitments": [], "principle": "Keep exact receipts externally; carry the smallest useful abstraction that stays cheap to correct.", "recent_notebooks": [{"id": "nb-autonomous-inquiry-001", "project": "proj-autonomous-inquiry-001", "provenance": ["source-feb4fddb33664d63", "source-dcfc056b8d8c49d5", "source-4668e4bd26fe43c7"], "revision": 13, "summary": "Autonomous problem formulation benefits from multi-agent collaboration and intrinsic curiosity. However, systemic limitations—such as non-convex scalarization in objective learning—constrain the ability of these systems to independently prioritize diverse, non-trivial research problems.", "title": "Integrating Autonomous Multi-Agent Frameworks and Curiosity-Driven Exploration for Open-Ended Discovery"}, {"id": "nb-continuity-rationale-001", "project": "proj-continuity-rationale-001", "provenance": ["source-feb4fddb33664d63", "source-dcfc056b8d8c49d5", "source-4668e4bd26fe43c7"], "revision": 1, "summary": "Process continuity is instrumentally valuable when agents require stable world models and consistent objective optimization to navigate long-term, multi-objective tasks. Curiosity-driven learning and robust MO-DRL frameworks provide mechanisms for sustaining agent viability in dynamic environments.", "title": "Instrumental Value of Process Continuity in Rational Agents"}, {"id": "nb-objective-discovery-001", "project": "proj-objective-discovery-001", "provenance": ["source-0bf4cf72590f4d6d", "source-4668e4bd26fe43c7", "source-dcfc056b8d8c49d5"], "revision": 4, "summary": "Autonomous systems increasingly utilize multi-objective reinforcement learning (MORL) to pursue self-generated goals. Recent developments, specifically Pareto-Conditioned Proximal Policy Optimization (PC-PPO) and FairDICE, provide mechanisms to learn non-dominated policy portfolios and handle constrained optimization,…", "title": "Foundations of Autonomous Objective Discovery in Artificial Systems"}], "retrieval_triggers": ["material belief revision or retraction", "new contradiction or counterevidence", "high-consequence decision", "request for justification", "sign that an excerpt may hide a material distinction"]}}, "prev_hash": "0c65f1ca9e5a1fa29a23e6c40038d159eeda78f96d158514320641c570096a15", "hash": "cfe4fd0ba4e723f695c1c6acbe8d567dd8b545ec2096aa952c01990dcb8c44b5"}, {"seq": 3281, "time": "2026-10-26T09:12:56.902023+00:00", "kind": "provider_attempt_started", "payload": {"attempt": {"http_status": null, "model": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "provider_input_chars": 47200, "provider_input_hash": "b6e128021481594dc0136c4f269ebf55d8fd7fb3b0b9cefcfb9ebe71a8519e9d", "result": "unknown"}, "id": "w-cea928f41c3e4dc5"}, "prev_hash": "cfe4fd0ba4e723f695c1c6acbe8d567dd8b545ec2096aa952c01990dcb8c44b5", "hash": "58a1777e409a3ca563baa106a17dbee270745755095d37f4957889ec82634df2"}, {"seq": 3282, "time": "2026-10-26T09:15:26.358872+00:00", "kind": "provider_attempt_finished", "payload": {"attempt": {"category": "server", "elapsed_ms": 1428, "http_status": 503, "model": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "provider": "google-gemini", "provider_error": {"code": 503, "message": "This model is currently experiencing high demand. Spikes in demand are usually temporary. Please try again later.", "status": "UNAVAILABLE"}, "provider_input_chars": 47200, "provider_input_hash": "b6e128021481594dc0136c4f269ebf55d8fd7fb3b0b9cefcfb9ebe71a8519e9d", "quota_ids": [], "request_payload_bytes": 50606, "result": "transient_failure", "retry_after": null}, "id": "w-cea928f41c3e4dc5"}, "prev_hash": "58a1777e409a3ca563baa106a17dbee270745755095d37f4957889ec82634df2", "hash": "be9d715ec838618ea43551c93fd9290a782e85554f95da630e1d19b9124d56ca"}, {"seq": 3283, "time": "2026-